    "detailed_description": "Banana Yetti is an addictive and fast paced arcade game that will keep you on your toes.<br />\r\nThe game features a cute and adorable yeti character that the player takes control of.<br />\r\nThe goal of the game is to help the Yeti collect bananas and survive the harsh winter season.<br />\r\njumping from one rock to another, overcoming various obstacles on your way.<br />\r\nThe player must be careful not to fall off the rocks while collecting as many bananas as possible.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you progress through the game, you will encounter increasingly difficult weather conditions.<br />\r\nSnowstorms and low temperatures will make it difficult for the Yeti to survive. The ultimate goal is to help the Yeti survive the winter and<br />\r\ncollect as many bananas as possible before the end of the season. With each level, the obstacles become more difficult,<br />\r\nand weather conditions are more insidious.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nManagement in the game is simple and convenient. Players can use arrows or W, A, S, D to move<br />\r\nYeti character on screen. The game has vibrant graphics and exciting sound effects that will keep<br />\r\nkeep you on your toes for hours on end. So, get ready to go on an exciting adventure.<br />\r\nwith the Banana Yeti and help the Yeti survive the winter by collecting as many bananas as possible.",
